<title>UK: Astec appoints new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Astec appoints new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British power conversion electronics specialist Astec Plc said on Wednesday it had appointed Howard Lance as chief executive.</p>
<p>Lance takes over from David Farr who is joining Emerson Electric Co in a senior executive position.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
